  "scope": "Twelve fixed API-schema-selected repository inputs plus four frozen ordinary controls. Native basic-settings action and API projection cover the same four writable fields; complete API readback and a separately timed shared trust-model measurement cover preserved state.",
  "api_operation_binding": "PATCH /repos/{owner}/{repo} changes only supplied fields. The native action=update handler writes Name, Description, Website and IsTemplate; send all four corresponding fields in the API comparator. Private, default branch and trust settings are preserved and independently checked in full readback.",
  "shared_metadata_oracle": "Repository GET omits trust_model. Both branches additionally read the signing-settings radio state before and after their edit using the authenticated browser; observations and read time are separate. This is a shared read-only metadata measurement, not an API-only observable. No API-only completeness claim is made for this field.",
